# The shipped skill bundle is checksum-pinned: scripts/grok-bot* verify
# bin/grok-bot.mjs against bin/SHA256SUMS before every run. Line-ending
# conversion would change the hash, so these files must stay byte-identical
# to the repository blob on every platform. Without this, a Windows checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true is the Git for Windows default) rewrites grok-bot.mjs
# to CRLF and every `grok-bot` invocation fails with CLI_CHECKSUM_MISMATCH.
desktop/resources/grok-bot-skill/** -text
